+## Budgets
+
+tally ships with default monthly budgets for each category (defined in
+`tally/config.py`). The `budget` command shows how much you have spent against
+each budget for a given month:
+
+```
+tally budget --month 2024-03
+```
+
+The output flags a category as `over` once it exceeds its budget and `warn`
+once it crosses 80% of the limit. To change the limits, edit `CATEGORY_BUDGETS`
+in `tally/config.py`.
+
